  "prefLabel": "Puc 1602.10 Rate",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 1602.10 “Rate” means any charge or price, and all related service provisions for services regulated and tariffed by the commission, including, but not limited to, availability, terms of payment, and minimum service period.\n\nSource. #14030, eff 7-25-24 (formerly Puc 1602.04)",
